  ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="page" id="page-about">
    <div class="sec-wrap">
      <div class="sec-eyebrow">The Researcher</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">About Naredla Rama Chandra</h2>
      <div class="sec-rule"></div>
      <div class="about-layout">
        <div class="about-photo-col">
          <div class="photo-wrap">
            <div class="photo-frame"></div>
            <img src="mywebsite/photo_for_ref.jpg" alt="Naredla Rama Chandra" class="about-photo">
          </div>
          <div class="about-quote">"Let the light deep within illumine — Show everyone your light."</div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2>Naredla Rama Chandra</h2>
          <div class="role">Independent Researcher · Author · Consciousness Explorer</div>
          <p>Naredla Rama Chandra is an independent researcher and prolific author whose life's work is dedicated to uncovering the profound scientific foundations embedded within Ancient Indian classical traditions. His research bridges disciplines long considered separate — music, dance, linguistics, astrophysics, medicine and neuroscience.</p>
          <p>Rooted in the traditions of <strong>Carnatic music and classical Indian arts</strong>, his work decodes the seven Sapta Swaras as a complete bio-acoustic healing system, and maps the 108 Karanas of Bharatanatyam to neurological and astrophysical principles that modern science is only beginning to appreciate.</p>
          <p>His landmark research culminates in the <strong>"Master Consciousness Protocol"</strong> — an integrated framework for natural healing and the systematic elevation of human potential through sound, movement and sacred language.</p>
          <p>Author of 8 major research publications, he continues to seek collaborators from the fields of neurology, clinical medicine, bio-acoustics and Vedic studies.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">Carnatic Music</span><span class="tag">Neuroscience</span><span class="tag">Bio-acoustics</span><span class="tag">Sanskrit</span><span class="tag">Vedic Science</span><span class="tag">Consciousness</span><span class="tag">Bharatanatyam</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stats-row">
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">8</span><div class="stat-lbl">Publications</div></div>
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">108</span><div class="stat-lbl">Karanas</div></div>
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">7</span><div class="stat-lbl">Sapta Swaras</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="site-footer">© 2025 <span>culturalmusings.com</span> · Naredla Rama Chandra</div>
  </div>

