      <div class="book-card"><span class="book-num">02</span><div class="book-title">Master Reference Compendium</div><div class="book-desc">Integrated research standards for cross-disciplinary study of ancient Indian knowledge frameworks.</div><span class="book-tag">Research</span></div>
      <div class="book-card"><span class="book-num">03</span><div class="book-title">Sapta Swaras &amp; Healing</div><div class="book-desc">A scientific treatise on the seven sacred notes of Carnatic music as a complete bio-acoustic healing system.</div><span class="book-tag">Music Science</span></div>
      <div class="book-card"><span class="book-num">04</span><div class="book-title">108 Karanas &amp; Beeja Aksharas</div><div class="book-desc">Foundations connecting Bharatanatyam's 108 postures with astrophysics and medical science.</div><span class="book-tag">Astrophysics</span></div>
      <div class="book-card"><span class="book-num">05</span><div class="book-title">Yoga: The Eternal Science</div><div class="book-desc">Exploring Vedic roots of Yoga as a systematic science for modern neurology and healing.</div><span class="book-tag">Vedic Science</span></div>
      <div class="book-card"><span class="book-num">06</span><div class="book-title">Shabda Brahman</div><div class="book-desc">The Sacred Science of Sound — exploring primordial vibration as the basis of consciousness and creation.</div><span class="book-tag">Sacred Sound</span></div>
      <div class="book-card"><span class="book-num">07</span><div class="book-title">The Cosmic Choreography</div><div class="book-desc">A deep study of Shankaracharya's metaphysics and its relevance to modern cosmological science.</div><span class="book-tag">Metaphysics</span></div>
      <div class="book-card"><span class="book-num">08</span><div class="book-title">Sanskrit &amp; AI</div><div class="book-desc">Neurological Healing and Programming through the precise computational grammar of Sanskrit.</div><span class="book-tag">Sanskrit · AI</span></div>
