      <div class="sec-rule" style="margin:0 auto 16px;"></div>
      <p>Interdisciplinary research connecting the ancient arts of India with cutting-edge modern science, seeking collaborators for clinical studies.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="research-grid">
      <div class="research-card"><span class="rc-icon">🎵</span><div class="rc-title">Bio-Acoustic Healing</div><div class="rc-text">Studying how Carnatic ragas and Sapta Swaras interact with the autonomic nervous system, brain wave states, and cellular regeneration processes.</div></div>
      <div class="research-card"><span class="rc-icon">🧬</span><div class="rc-title">Neuro-Sanskrit Studies</div><div class="rc-text">Investigating Sanskrit's unique phonemic structure as a neurological programming language capable of restructuring neural pathways.</div></div>
      <div class="research-card"><span class="rc-icon">🌀</span><div class="rc-title">108 Karanas Mapping</div><div class="rc-text">Mapping the 108 classical dance postures of Bharatanatyam to meridian systems, astrophysical alignments, and endocrine functions.</div></div>
      <div class="research-card"><span class="rc-icon">⭐</span><div class="rc-title">Beeja Akshara Science</div><div class="rc-text">Decoding seed syllables as precise vibrational keys that activate specific neurological and physiological responses in the human body.</div></div>
      <div class="research-card"><span class="rc-icon">🧠</span><div class="rc-title">Consciousness Mapping</div><div class="rc-text">Developing frameworks that correlate ancient states of consciousness (samadhi, turiya) with measurable neurological and brainwave signatures.</div></div>
      <div class="research-card"><span class="rc-icon">🌺</span><div class="rc-title">Yoga Neuroscience</div><div class="rc-text">Establishing scientific verification of Vedic Yoga practices through modern neuroimaging, endocrinology and psychophysiology.</div></div>
    </div>
